#: js/dist/yoastseo-woo-product-images-1700.js:18
#, js-format
msgid ""
"Enable AI-powered SEO! Use all Yoast AI features to boost your efficiency. "
"Just give us the green light. %1$s%2$sLearn more%3$s%4$s"
